"<command>zonetab2pot.py</command><group><option><replaceable> "
"समयक्षेत्र-सूची</replaceable></option></group>"

# automatic translation
#: man-zonetab2pot.py.1.docbook:32
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "Description"
msgstr "वर्णनम्‌"

# automatic translation
#: man-zonetab2pot.py.1.docbook:34
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<command>zonetab2pot.py</command> reads the timezone list given on the "
"command-line and converts it to a gettext message file (PO-file) template "
"containing the names of the individual timezones."
msgstr ""
"<command>zonetab2pot.py</command> आदेशपङ्क्तौ दत्तां समयक्षेत्रसूचीं पठति "
"तथा च व्यक्तिगतसमयक्षेत्रस्य नाम समाविष्टं gettext message file (PO-file) "
"टेम्पलेट् मध्ये परिवर्तयति"

# automatic translation
#: man-zonetab2pot.py.1.docbook:39
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The given timezone list should be in the same format as the system "
"zone.tab. If no timezone list is specified on the command-line, "
"<filename>/usr/share/zoneinfo/zone.tab</filename> will be used."
msgstr ""
"दत्ता समयक्षेत्रसूची system zone.tab इत्यस्य समानरूपेण भवितुमर्हति । यदि "
"आदेशपङ्क्तौ कोऽपि समयक्षेत्रसूची निर्दिष्टा नास्ति तर्हि "
"<filename>/usr/share/zoneinfo/zone.tab</filename> इत्यस्य उपयोगः भविष्यति ।"

# automatic translation
#: man-zonetab2pot.py.1.docbook:43
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "The new PO-file template will be written to standard output."
msgstr "नूतनं PO-सञ्चिका टेम्पलेट् मानकनिर्गमं प्रति लिखितं भविष्यति ।"

# automatic translation
#: man-zonetab2pot.py.1.docbook:45
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "This utility is part of the KDE Software Development Kit."
msgstr "इयं उपयोगिता KDE Software Development Kit इत्यस्य भागः अस्ति ।"

